INSERT INTO `node__field_hotel_description` VALUES
('hotels',0,2,17,'en',0,'<p>At Tranquil Stay Hotel, we prioritize your comfort and satisfaction. Nestled in the heart of the city, our hotel offers a serene escape with luxurious amenities and top-notch service. Whether you\'re here for business or leisure, we promise an unforgettable experience. Enjoy our elegantly furnished rooms, a rejuvenating spa, and gourmet dining that will tantalize your taste buds.</p>','basic_html'),
('hotels',0,3,38,'en',0,'<p>Welcome to Blue Lagoon Resort, where elegance meets tranquility. Our beautifully designed rooms and exceptional hospitality ensure a relaxing and enjoyable stay. Immerse yourself in the exquisite surroundings and let us take care of your every need. From our pristine swimming pool to our state-of-the-art fitness center, every detail is crafted to provide you with a memorable experience.</p>','basic_html'),
('hotels',0,4,37,'en',0,'<p>Majestic Heights invites you to experience the perfect blend of luxury and comfort. Our dedicated staff is committed to making your stay memorable with personalized service and unparalleled amenities. Relax, unwind, and enjoy the finest hospitality in the city. Take advantage of our modern business center, spacious conference rooms, and exquisite dining options to enhance your stay.</p>','basic_html'),
('hotels',0,6,36,'en',0,'<p>Crystal Palace Hotel offers an exquisite retreat where modern elegance meets timeless charm. Our hotel provides a sanctuary in the bustling city with beautifully appointed rooms and exceptional service. Whether you\'re here for a short stay or an extended vacation, you\'ll find everything you need to relax and unwind. Enjoy our rooftop pool, world-class dining, and stunning city views.</p>','basic_html'),
('hotels',0,7,35,'en',0,'<p>Ocean Breeze invites you to relax and rejuvenate by the sea. Located on the pristine shores, our resort offers breathtaking ocean views and luxurious accommodations. Experience the soothing sounds of the waves as you enjoy our top-tier amenities, including beachside dining, water sports, and a tranquil spa. Our dedicated team is here to ensure your stay is nothing short of perfection.</p>','basic_html'),
('hotels',0,8,34,'en',0,'<p>Green Valley Lodge combines nature\'s beauty with modern living\'s comforts. Nestled in a picturesque valley, our lodge offers a serene escape with stunning natural surroundings and luxurious accommodations. Enjoy hiking trails, cosy fireplaces, and gourmet cuisine that celebrates local flavours. Whether you\'re here for adventure or relaxation, Green Valley Lodge promises an unforgettable experience.</p>','basic_html'),
('hotels',0,9,32,'en',0,'<p>Royal Crest Hotel sets the standard for luxury and elegance. Located in the heart of the city, our hotel offers world-class amenities and impeccable service. Each room is a masterpiece of design, ensuring the utmost in comfort and sophistication. Indulge in our fine dining restaurants, unwind at our exclusive spa, and enjoy panoramic views from our rooftop lounge. At Royal Crest Hotel, every detail is crafted to perfection.</p>','basic_html');
