('text',0,47,158,'en',0,'<p>We are our clients’ co-entrepreneurs. We develop experience strategies, digital services &amp; products as well as content &amp; campaigns. And we deliver the IT that supports all of this.</p><p>We are our clients’ co-entrepreneurs. We develop experience strategies, digital services &amp; products as well as content &amp; campaigns. And we deliver the IT that supports all of this. We are our clients’ co-entrepreneurs. We develop experience strategies, digital services &amp; products as well as content &amp; campaigns.</p>','basic_html');
